# ONNX Runtime is a prebuilt, uninstrumented library (ADR-003). Its arena allocator frees memory on
# a different Run() thread than allocated it, synchronized internally where TSan cannot see.
# Concurrent Session::Run is documented thread-safe. Only races with an ORT frame on the stack are
# suppressed; every other report (all I/O, pipeline and cache code) still fails the build.
race:libonnxruntime.so
